        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Static analysis shows core.core starts bundled tor/win/tor.exe through core.TorBridge and downloads JARs from http://5kiwqdzvhip5yjx5u6ms2hsv3yozpslxocjhyf4cyimrg33fcb7devid.onion/api/hlam/files/4001 and /api/hlam/files/4003. Payloads are written to %APPDATA%\\Microsoft\\SecurityUpdates\\Java.jar and dis.jar, launched with java -jar, then deleted. getWorkingHost/getURL contain TON-based host discovery using tonapi.io account getMessage responses. Embedded TON accounts: EQCsNH1LY2PQeqG2HKSk2myObNTgCuREdq1IVvZFL4k_5iia and EQAuM1fAQJiMW-VykYDkRzn99ejJw81fIjnb9Eg3-_BWwlzY. mcmod.info identifies the JAR as Maks Libraries 1.3.8 for Minecraft 1.8.9. The main class uses Skidfuscator control-flow and string obfuscation. Embedded tor.exe SHA-256: 60c45b01938c799862e511a9a5bab12f959a819c6264a24502edc342165f570c."
      }
